# INVWINQA.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the Record menu
# at level 3, reached by ALT-C, and the titles and delete questions of
# the lists it opens.  Every snapshot lists the menu bar, the Record
# entries and their grayed state.  On the item list Parts shows item 1's
# parts, none, the frame titled for them; INS adds item 3, and Install part,
# Move and Open are then at work on the list.  ENTER shows the part in the
# item form, whose Parts button, clicked, shows item 3's parts, nested one
# level deeper; ESC goes back through the form and the parts, Back to the item
# list, each title restored.  Move and Duplicate show the move dialog and item
# 1 duplicated as item 4, its form shown, whose ESC deletes the copy again;
# Service records and Back go to the records of item 1 and out, and Used with
# it and Back to what is used with item 1, nothing, and out.  A loan added
# makes item 1's loans and holds a list of one row, and Loans and holds from
# the Items menu the open rows, where Open item takes the place of Install in,
# Next list that of Next order and Return or release that of Take out.
# Locations > Browse locations has Move, whose pick list Esc closes.  DEL
# through the menu asks "Delete item" for an item, ENTER keeps it (the default
# is No); DEL on a location asks with its name, N keeps it; on a user it asks
# for the name only.  The end by Exit.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINQA.SNP is its
# snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
S ITEMS
# Parts through the menu: none, then Install part adds item 3
K ALT-C P
S NOPARTS
K ALT-C I
S INSTPART
T 3
K ENTER
S PARTS
# the part in its form, whose Parts button opens its own parts, one level
# deeper; ESC comes back to the form and the parts and Back to the item list,
# each title restored
K ENTER
S PARTFORM
M 148 DOWN MID
M 148 UP MID
S NESTED
K ESC
S FORMBACK
K ESC
S PARTBACK
K ALT-C B
S ITEMBACK
# Move and Duplicate through the menu: the move dialog, the copy's form
K ALT-C M
S MOVE
K ESC
S MOVEESC
K ALT-C C
S COPY
K ESC
S COPIED
# Service records, and Back out of them
K HOME ALT-C S
S SERVICE
K ALT-C B
S SERVBACK
# Used with it, and Back out of it
K ALT-C W
S USED
K ALT-C B
# Loans and holds: a loan added, item 1's list, the open rows
K ALT-C A
S NOLOANS
K INS
K TAB
T Carol King
K TAB TAB
T 2020-01-01
K TAB
T 2020-02-01
K ENTER
S LOANS
K ESC ALT-I O
S OPEN
K ESC
S OPENBACK
# the location tree
K ALT-L B
S LOCS
K ALT-C M
S MOVE
K ESC
S LOCSBACK
# the delete questions: an item, a location, a user
K DEL
S ASKLOC
K N
S LOCKEPT
K ESC DOWN ALT-C D
S ASKITEM
K ENTER
S ITEMKEPT
K ALT-A U
S USERS
K DEL
S ASKUSER
K ENTER
S USERKEPT
K ESC ALT-F X
